eparated from the land of the tabernacle of ׳ י Josh 22:19 ( P ); so ׳ אדמה ט a foreign land Amos 7:17 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3347')\">BDB3347</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H2931')\">H2931</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3346')\">BDB3346</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3348')\">BDB3348</entry></div><p> II. <bdbheb>טָמֵא</bdbheb> <b>adjective</b> <highlightword>unclean</highlightword>; — <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ט</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lev 5:2\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(3,5,2)\">Lev 5:2</ref> + 58 t.; construct <bdbheb>טְמֵא</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lev 22:4\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(3,22,4)\">Lev 22:4</ref> + 3 t.; feminine <bdbheb>טְמֵאָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lev 5:2\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(3,5,2)\">Lev 5:2</ref> + 11 t.; construct <bdbheb>טְמֵאַת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 22:5\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(26,22,5)\">Ezek 22:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 22:10\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(26,22,10)\">Ezek 22:10</ref> plural <bdbheb>טְמֵאִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lev 11:8\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(3,11,8)\">Lev 11:8</ref> + 10 t.; — <highlight>unclean</highlight>, <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> ethically and religiously <bdbheb>שׂפתים</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ט</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 6:5\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(23,6,5)\">Isa 6:5</ref> (twice in verse) <highlight>unclean of lips</highlight>; <bdbheb>השׁם</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ט</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 22:5\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(26,22,5)\">Ezek 22:5</ref> <highlight>defiled of name, infamous</highlight>; <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>טהור מִטּ</bd